# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TECHNICAL STACK & HARDWARE MANDATES
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Rust core (`crates/relulayer-core`)
- `#![no_std]` and `#![deny(unsafe_code)]` required.
- ZERO heap allocation: `no_alloc` / no `alloc` crate in hot path.
- Static, stack-allocated arrays only; no dynamic containers.
- All arithmetic MUST use Q16.16 fixed-point signed integers (`i32`, 16 fractional bits).
- NEVER use `f32` or `f64` floats inside `relulayer-core`.
- Symplectic Auditor: verify determinant of Jacobian `det(J) == 1.0` in Q16.16 (target `65_536`, tolerance `<= 65`).

## Embedded Microcontroller Target & Metrics
- Target MCU: STM32H743BIT6 / Pixhawk 6X @ 480 MHz ARM Cortex-M7 core.
- Compiler Flags: `-mcpu=cortex-m7 -mthumb -mfloat-abi=hard -mfpu=fpv5-d16`
- Latency Bound: 128 CPU cycles worst-case (~267 ns at 480 MHz).
- Zero-Heap Linker Boundary: Trapped via `_sbrk` stub in `hil/syscalls.c` returning `(void *)-1` with `errno = ENOMEM`.
- Avionics Standards: RTCA DO-178C DAL A memory determinism, MIL-STD-882E safe-state fallback, CMMC Level 1 alignment.

## Python Bindings & Telemetry (`crates/relulayer-py`)
- Use PyO3 0.23+ syntax with `&Bound<'_, PyModule>` smart pointers.
- Compile via `maturin develop` inside WSL CPython 3.13: `/home/iamin/miniconda3/bin/python`.
- Telemetry Ingestion: Stream `data/trajair_outdoor_flight.csv` and `data/nanobench_swarm_formation.csv`.
- Overlay real flight kinematics and EKF noise (+/- 0.35 m) on all simulations.

